{"CFDocument":{"identifier":"47f395ca-ca8b-11e9-a290-9f8254c7eb1f","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/47f395ca-ca8b-11e9-a290-9f8254c7eb1f","creator":"World Language Prototype","title":"World-Readiness Standards for Language Learners (ACTFL - Example)","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-08-29T18:31:56+00:00","adoptionStatus":"Draft"},"CFItems":[{"identifier":"5381b304-ca8b-11e9-846c-51912159fe66","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5381b304-ca8b-11e9-846c-51912159fe66","fullStatement":"**Communication**: Learners communicate effectively in more than one language in order to function in a variety of situations and for multiple purposes.","CFItemType":"Goal Area","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Goal Area","identifier":"59649510-a55e-11e7-a107-c785862356e8","uri":"https://ky.satchelcommons.com/ims/case/v1p0/CFItemTypes/59649510-a55e-11e7-a107-c785862356e8"},"humanCodingScheme":"Goal Area 1","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:24:10+00:00"},{"identifier":"5b688778-ca8b-11e9-9b69-73ae5d9835cd","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5b688778-ca8b-11e9-9b69-73ae5d9835cd","fullStatement":"**Presentational Communication**: Learners present information, concepts, and ideas to inform, explain, persuade, and narrate on a variety of topics using appropriate media and adapting to various audiences of listeners, readers, or viewers.","CFItemType":"Standard","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Standard","identifier":"2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969","uri":"https://ky.satchelcommons.com/ims/case/v1p0/CFItemTypes/2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969"},"humanCodingScheme":"Standard 1.3 (Speaking)","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:40:35+00:00"},{"identifier":"ef9a3496-ca8b-11e9-a897-97b81318537f","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/ef9a3496-ca8b-11e9-a897-97b81318537f","fullStatement":"Novice Higher Learners can present basic information on familiar topics using language they have practiced using phrases and simple sentences.\r\n\r\nNovice High Learners can\r\n\r\n- present information about their life using phrases and simple sentences\r\n- tell about a familiar experience or event using phrases and simple sentences\r\n- present basic information about a familiar person, place, or thing using phrases and simple sentences","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice High","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:40:09+00:00"},{"identifier":"1d5d99b2-d93d-11e9-a6d7-2be26d846657","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d5d99b2-d93d-11e9-a6d7-2be26d846657","fullStatement":"**Interpersonal Communication**: Learners interact and negotiate meaning in spoken, signed, or written conversations to share information, reactions, feelings, and opinions.","CFItemType":"Standard","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Standard","identifier":"2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969","uri":"https://ky.satchelcommons.com/ims/case/v1p0/CFItemTypes/2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969"},"humanCodingScheme":"Standard 1.1","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:40:35+00:00"},{"identifier":"54275172-d93d-11e9-b1ee-5923b362f8b5","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/54275172-d93d-11e9-b1ee-5923b362f8b5","fullStatement":"Novice Low Learners can communicate on some very familiar topics using single words and phrases.\r\n\r\n**Novice Low Learners can**\r\n\r\n- greet peers\r\n- introduce self to someone\r\n- answer a few simple questions","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Low","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:29:22+00:00"},{"identifier":"9402ab70-d93d-11e9-96ea-65c7934512cd","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/9402ab70-d93d-11e9-96ea-65c7934512cd","fullStatement":"Novice Mid Learners can communicate on very familiar topics using a variety of words and phrases that they have practiced and memorized.\r\n\r\n**Novice Mid Learners can**\r\n\r\n- greet and leave people in a polite way\r\n- introduce self and others\r\n- answer a variety of simple questions\r\n- make some simple statements in a conversation\r\n- ask some simple questions\r\n- communicate basic information about self and people they know\r\n- communicate some basic information about their everyday lives","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Mid","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:29:22+00:00"},{"identifier":"fd89d0fa-d93d-11e9-94f0-397482b88201","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/fd89d0fa-d93d-11e9-94f0-397482b88201","fullStatement":"Novice High Learners can communicate and exchange information about familiar topics using phrases and simple sentences sometimes supported by memorized language. They can usually handle short social interactions in everyday situations by asking and answering simple questions.\r\n\r\n**Novice High Learners can**\r\n\r\n- exchange some personal information\r\n- exchange information using texts, graphs, or pictures\r\n- ask for and give simple directions\r\n- make plans with others\r\n- interact with others in everyday situations","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice High","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:29:22+00:00"},{"identifier":"491539f8-d95f-11e9-b827-b32bbde9c896","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/491539f8-d95f-11e9-b827-b32bbde9c896","fullStatement":"**Interpretive Communication**: Learners understand, interpret, and analyze what is heard, read, or viewed on a variety of topics.","CFItemType":"Standard","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Standard","identifier":"2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969","uri":"https://ky.satchelcommons.com/ims/case/v1p0/CFItemTypes/2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969"},"humanCodingScheme":"Standard 1.2 (Listening)","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:40:35+00:00"},{"identifier":"883e0614-d95f-11e9-b441-6163baaba70d","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/883e0614-d95f-11e9-b441-6163baaba70d","fullStatement":"Novice Low Learners can recognize a few memorized words and phrases when they hear them spoken.\r\n\r\n**Novice Low Learners can**\r\n\r\n- occasionally identify the sound of a character or a word\r\n- occasionally understand isolated words that have been memorized, particularly when accompanied by gestures or pictures","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Low","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:32:30+00:00"},{"identifier":"c8c1b7d0-d95f-11e9-aacf-0da2e598d57d","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/c8c1b7d0-d95f-11e9-aacf-0da2e598d57d","fullStatement":"Novice Mid Learners can recognize some familiar words and phrases when they hear them spoken.\r\n\r\n**Novice Mid Learners can**\r\n\r\n- understand a few courtesy phrases.\r\n- recognize and sometimes understand basic information in words and phrases that they have memorized\r\n- recognize and sometimes understand words and phrases that they have learned for specific purposes","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Mid","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:32:30+00:00"},{"identifier":"db0a4650-d95f-11e9-8e91-7d810b3990e1","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/db0a4650-d95f-11e9-8e91-7d810b3990e1","fullStatement":"Novice High Learners can often understand words, phrases, and simple sentences related to everyday life. They can recognize pieces of information and sometimes understand the main topic of what is being said.\r\n\r\n**Novice High Learners can**\r\n\r\n- sometimes understand simple questions or statements on familiar topics.\r\n- understand simple information when presented with pictures and graphs.\r\n- sometimes understand the main topic of conversations that they overhear.","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice High","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:36:37+00:00"},{"identifier":"5c86382e-d960-11e9-9191-8f1fd6a6b8d3","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5c86382e-d960-11e9-9191-8f1fd6a6b8d3","fullStatement":"**Interpretive Communication**: Learners understand, interpret, and analyze what is heard, read, or viewed on a variety of topics.","CFItemType":"Standard","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Standard","identifier":"2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969","uri":"https://ky.satchelcommons.com/ims/case/v1p0/CFItemTypes/2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969"},"humanCodingScheme":"Standard 1.2 (Reading)","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:40:35+00:00"},{"identifier":"5c86764a-d960-11e9-908d-27d12267c6af","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5c86764a-d960-11e9-908d-27d12267c6af","fullStatement":"Novice Low Learners can recognize a few letters or characters. They can identify a few memorized words and phrases when they read. \r\n\r\n**Novice Low Learners can**\r\n\r\n- recognize a few letters or characters\r\n- connect some words, phrases, or characters to their meanings","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Low","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:34:32+00:00"},{"identifier":"5c86962a-d960-11e9-b048-fba2251ee6b7","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5c86962a-d960-11e9-b048-fba2251ee6b7","fullStatement":"Novice Mid Learners can recognize some letters or characters. They can understand some learned or memorized words and phrases when they read.\r\n\r\n**Novice Mid Learners can**\r\n\r\n- recognize words, phrases, and characters with the help of visuals\r\n- recognize words, phrases, and characters when they associate them with things they already know","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Mid","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:35:12+00:00"},{"identifier":"5c86b4a2-d960-11e9-a78f-45ebcb3a366d","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5c86b4a2-d960-11e9-a78f-45ebcb3a366d","fullStatement":"Novice High Learners can understand familiar words, phrases, and sentences within short and simple texts related to everyday life. They can sometimes understand the main idea of what they have read.\r\n\r\n**Novice High Learners can**\r\n\r\n- usually understand short simple messages on familiar topics\r\n- sometimes understand short, simple descriptions with the help of pictures or graphs\r\n- sometimes understand the main idea of published materials\r\n- understand simple everyday notices in public places on topics that are familiar to them","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice High","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:36:07+00:00"},{"identifier":"283c895a-d961-11e9-92b1-1bc666babac0","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/283c895a-d961-11e9-92b1-1bc666babac0","fullStatement":"Novice Low Learners can present information about themselves and some other very familiar topics using single words or memorized phrases.\r\n\r\n**Novice Low Learners can**\r\n\r\n- recite words and phrases that they have learned\r\n- state the names of familiar people, places, and objects in pictures and posters using words or memorized phrases\r\n- introduce themselves to a group.\r\n- recite short memorized phrases, parts of poems, and rhymes","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Low","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:39:27+00:00"},{"identifier":"536a2cc2-d961-11e9-8bd2-5b8ae8178846","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/536a2cc2-d961-11e9-8bd2-5b8ae8178846","fullStatement":"Novice Mid Learners can present information about themselves and some other very familiar topics using a variety of words, phrases, and memorized expressions.","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Mid","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:39:27+00:00"},{"identifier":"7d6ad364-d961-11e9-9248-7b542dbea433","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/7d6ad364-d961-11e9-9248-7b542dbea433","fullStatement":"**Presentational Communication**: Learners present information, concepts, and ideas to inform, explain, persuade, and narrate on a variety of topics using appropriate media and adapting to various audiences of listeners, readers, or viewers.","CFItemType":"Standard","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Standard","identifier":"2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969","uri":"https://ky.satchelcommons.com/ims/case/v1p0/CFItemTypes/2d745335-aa67-4729-a42a-5cffd08b6969"},"humanCodingScheme":"Standard 1.3 (Writing)","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:40:54+00:00"},{"identifier":"7d6b111c-d961-11e9-bb05-7f4f3ce541f2","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/7d6b111c-d961-11e9-bb05-7f4f3ce541f2","fullStatement":"Novice High Learners can write short messages and notes on familiar topics related to everyday life\r\n\r\n**Novice High Learners can**\r\n\r\n- write information about their daily life in a letter, blog, discussion board, or email message\r\n- write short notes using phrases and simple sentences\r\n- write about a familiar experience or event using practiced material\r\n- write basic information about things they have learned\r\n- ask for information in writing","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice High","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:43:30+00:00"},{"identifier":"7d6b2e40-d961-11e9-a300-e74dfb847aed","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/7d6b2e40-d961-11e9-a300-e74dfb847aed","fullStatement":"Novice Low Learners can copy some familiar words, characters, or phrases.\r\n\r\n**Novice Low Learners can**\r\n\r\n- copy some characters or letters and words that they see on the wall or board, in a book, or on the computer\r\n- write words and phrases that they have learned\r\n- label familiar people, places, and objects in pictures and posters","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Low","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:41:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"7d6b489e-d961-11e9-95a9-e9f63f6256ac","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/7d6b489e-d961-11e9-95a9-e9f63f6256ac","fullStatement":"Novice Mid Learners can write lists and memorized phrases on familiar topics.\r\n\r\n**Novice Mid Learners can**\r\n\r\n- fill out a simple form with some basic personal information\r\n- write about themselves using learned phrases and memorized expressions\r\n- list their daily activities and write lists that help them in their day-to-day life\r\n- write notes about something they have learned using lists, phrases, and memorized expressions","CFItemType":"Performance Level","CFItemTypeURI":{"title":"Performance Level","identifier":"1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/1d7d9aea-7edf-11e9-a416-7f8726078123"},"humanCodingScheme":"Novice Mid","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:42:41+00:00"}],"CFAssociations":[{"identifier":"5381b5d4-ca8b-11e9-bfcc-835ccbd541ee","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5381b5d4-ca8b-11e9-bfcc-835ccbd541ee","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-08-29T18:32:16+00:00","sequenceNumber":0,"originNodeURI":{"title":"Goal Area 1","identifier":"5381b304-ca8b-11e9-846c-51912159fe66","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5381b304-ca8b-11e9-846c-51912159fe66"},"associationType":"isChildOf","destinationNodeURI":{"title":"World-Readiness Standards for Language Learners (ACTFL - Exa","identifier":"47f395ca-ca8b-11e9-a290-9f8254c7eb1f","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/47f395ca-ca8b-11e9-a290-9f8254c7eb1f"}},{"identifier":"5b6889d0-ca8b-11e9-bad8-6f0bf2088c4e","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5b6889d0-ca8b-11e9-bad8-6f0bf2088c4e","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-09-17T15:40:35+00:00","sequenceNumber":4,"originNodeURI":{"title":"Standard 1.3 (Speaking)","identifier":"5b688778-ca8b-11e9-9b69-73ae5d9835cd","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5b688778-ca8b-11e9-9b69-73ae5d9835cd"},"associationType":"isChildOf","destinationNodeURI":{"title":"Goal Area 1","identifier":"5381b304-ca8b-11e9-846c-51912159fe66","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/5381b304-ca8b-11e9-846c-51912159fe66"}},{"identifier":"1d5d9d86-d93d-11e9-a2d8-39f3f776b724","uri":"https://